{"1612240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SmugForce", "steam_appid": 1612240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612240/extras/8004f9b25f11fb05eb874883154f9eef.avif?t=1785197657\" width=500 height=181 /></span><br><br>The Neon Raver Gang, LSD, has taken control of Smugtopia, turning the majority of the population into mindless ravers. Style your way with diving bullet time mechanics, super fast sliding, rocket jumping and much more discoverable tech! Trespass onto enemy territory with complete complacency including underground raves, abandoned skyscrapers, and more! Take back Smugtopia from the Neon Raver Gang known as LSD smugfully.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Insanely Smug Techniques</strong>:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612240/extras/f240a172622ca33cfa2ba8e0f32ab042.poster.avif?t=1785197657\" width=540 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612240/extras/f240a172622ca33cfa2ba8e0f32ab042.webm?t=1785197657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612240/extras/f240a172622ca33cfa2ba8e0f32ab042.mp4?t=1785197657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Dive</strong> into death-defying bullet time and <strong>Slide</strong> into the DM's at high speed dispatching enemies like a human bowling ball with physics focused gameplay.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Super Score Rush</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612240/extras/b8f74f3a6250f480b7d26954a0344bea.poster.avif?t=1785197657\" width=540 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612240/extras/b8f74f3a6250f480b7d26954a0344bea.webm?t=1785197657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612240/extras/b8f74f3a6250f480b7d26954a0344bea.mp4?t=1785197657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Challenge fellow Smugglers in a race against time and style with the <strong>Speedrun Mode</strong>. Full integration with Steam Leaderboard lets you pit yourself with Friends and the World<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be your own hero</strong></h2>With <strong>VRM support</strong>, recruit your own characters into the SmugForce.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lethal Weaponry</strong></h2>Customizable guns with tweakable parameters make every tool viable.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pro Gamer Options</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Ultrawide, 16:9, 16:10, and 4:3 support<br></li><li>Gamepad + Steam Deck compatible<br></li><li>Remappable Key and Gamepad Bindings<br></li><li>Plethora of accessibility options<br></li><li>Video Options, FPS Cap, Quality Settings<br></li><li>Steam Cloud Cross Save for on-the-go Smugging</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612240/extras/8004f9b25f11fb05eb874883154f9eef.avif?t=1785197657\" width=500 height=181 /></span><br><br>The Neon Raver Gang, LSD, has taken control of Smugtopia, turning the majority of the population into mindless ravers. Style your way with diving bullet time mechanics, super fast sliding, rocket jumping and much more discoverable tech! Trespass onto enemy territory with complete complacency including underground raves, abandoned skyscrapers, and more! Take back Smugtopia from the Neon Raver Gang known as LSD smugfully.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Insanely Smug Techniques</strong>:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612240/extras/f240a172622ca33cfa2ba8e0f32ab042.poster.avif?t=1785197657\" width=540 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612240/extras/f240a172622ca33cfa2ba8e0f32ab042.webm?t=1785197657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612240/extras/f240a172622ca33cfa2ba8e0f32ab042.mp4?t=1785197657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Dive</strong> into death-defying bullet time and <strong>Slide</strong> into the DM's at high speed dispatching enemies like a human bowling ball with physics focused gameplay.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Super Score Rush</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612240/extras/b8f74f3a6250f480b7d26954a0344bea.poster.avif?t=1785197657\" width=540 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612240/extras/b8f74f3a6250f480b7d26954a0344bea.webm?t=1785197657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612240/extras/b8f74f3a6250f480b7d26954a0344bea.mp4?t=1785197657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Challenge fellow Smugglers in a race against time and style with the <strong>Speedrun Mode</strong>. Full integration with Steam Leaderboard lets you pit yourself with Friends and the World<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be your own hero</strong></h2>With <strong>VRM support</strong>, recruit your own characters into the SmugForce.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lethal Weaponry</strong></h2>Customizable guns with tweakable parameters make every tool viable.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pro Gamer Options</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Ultrawide, 16:9, 16:10, and 4:3 support<br></li><li>Gamepad + Steam Deck compatible<br></li><li>Remappable Key and Gamepad Bindings<br></li><li>Plethora of accessibility options<br></li><li>Video Options, FPS Cap, Quality Settings<br></li><li>Steam Cloud Cross Save for on-the-go Smugging</li></ul>", "short_description": "Slide and Dive through enemy bullets inside hostile underground rave parties. Gun down the Raver Gang, and hunt down their leader to save Smugtopia in this physics based, third-person movement shooter.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612240/header.jpg?t=1785197657", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612240/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785197657", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612240/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785197657", "website": "https://x.com/SmugForceGame", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 / Windows 8.1 / Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 750 / AMD Radeon HD 7850<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 / Windows 8.1 / Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</st